{"steam_appid":2437330,"steam_name":"Novus Orbis","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437330/1689988837/0d18534ead20c0969b747ac566525b703c7e9ec3/1794592518/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1794593084","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257505130/ef357c89aedc854fec9cd9f8c4a41403208799ec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1794593084","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/7a3cd1e0522613109e4ed8188fc6d241e09eea79/ss_7a3cd1e0522613109e4ed8188fc6d241e09eea79.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794593343","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/aca53f36fa33e9b301d3b695d6e7d508eea1a5d5/ss_aca53f36fa33e9b301d3b695d6e7d508eea1a5d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794593343","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/4e767b4fe92cfcc1f6fc9e76e48f47cdef1f9df5/ss_4e767b4fe92cfcc1f6fc9e76e48f47cdef1f9df5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794593343","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/a7079de084b268a31770a4821802658b7b0f40b9/ss_a7079de084b268a31770a4821802658b7b0f40b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794593343","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/f100bf79ef58314d744fe86cd03aeac3b0a25818/ss_f100bf79ef58314d744fe86cd03aeac3b0a25818.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794593343"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Advance through the last pieces of this broken world, against an entity out of space and time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Novus Orbis </strong>is a roguelike deckbuilder that encourages complex builds with deep deck combos, powerful Blessings, and a wealth of secrets to discover. Chain together cards, mitigate enemy intents, and strengthen your might and knowledge to bring order back to your land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEEP DECKBUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/d74267791ed4624ac2f567c83121a43a.poster.avif?t=1794593343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/d74267791ed4624ac2f567c83121a43a.webm?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/d74267791ed4624ac2f567c83121a43a.mp4?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 3 classes</strong> (Warrior, Mage and Mechanic), each with their own card pool and vastly different mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations, develop powerful synergies, and create increasingly ridiculous builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft over <strong>300 Cards</strong> with a Mark-system for added abilities, earn <strong>100 build-altering Blessings</strong>, and recruit <strong>10 Pets</strong> to fight alongside you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHAIN COMBOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/796eff70680c54cdcdfe8f841dbe7ec5.poster.avif?t=1794593343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/796eff70680c54cdcdfe8f841dbe7ec5.webm?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/796eff70680c54cdcdfe8f841dbe7ec5.mp4?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has a cost and a combo value. <strong>The order in which you play your cards matters!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain cards together</strong> to build up powerful combos and unleash their full potential. Or strategically break the combo at the right time to get a more favorable outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how your cards interact, plan your sequences, and find creative ways to maximize every turn!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OUT OF TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/b7d7420fd7092a1f3ed03108f62ebde3.poster.avif?t=1794593343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/b7d7420fd7092a1f3ed03108f62ebde3.webm?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/b7d7420fd7092a1f3ed03108f62ebde3.mp4?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown System</strong>: Enemies will not sit patiently for you to finish your turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card you play brings them 1 step closer to attacking. Ending your turn advances the Countdown by 2. <strong>Plan your moves to guard against or avoid potential mid-turn attacks</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Turns strategically to effectively manage the Countdown. Do you spend another card setting up a devastating combo, or do you deal with the immediate threat before it's too late?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/113f73a15ab670391caaa3eb71ee26a5.poster.avif?t=1794593343\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/113f73a15ab670391caaa3eb71ee26a5.webm?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437330/extras/113f73a15ab670391caaa3eb71ee26a5.mp4?t=1794593343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run takes you through a branching world of interconnected paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Level Difficulty</strong>: clearing a level increases its difficulty the next time you visit, while losing resets it. Managing your route and chose when and where to push your luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter many events, secrets, and special interactions for added replayability. Every action, choice and path could mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8/8.1, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Seizo Games"],"publishers":["2 Left Thumbs"],"release_date":"13 Nov, 2026"}